<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls to 6.74 pct on 3-mo Italy BOTs.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls to 6.74 pct on 3-mo Italy BOTs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 36.5 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.74	(6.87)    98.40	  (98.37)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.63	(6.80)    96.80	  (96.72)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.55	(6.68)    93.85	  (93.75)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on December 11.</p>
</text>
